WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.450 line:88%
The Notion Developer portal → Internal connections.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.126 line:88%
Create a new connection: a name (e.g. MemuAI) and the workspace.

3
00:00:08.176 --> 00:00:12.568 line:88%
The Configuration tab → API token → copy it (it starts with ntn_).

4
00:00:12.618 --> 00:00:17.715 line:88%
The Content access tab → Edit access: tick the pages MemuAI may see.

5
00:00:17.765 --> 00:00:22.097 line:88%
In MemuAI: Settings → Integrations → Notion → «Integration token».

6
00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:27.792 line:88%
Paste the token and press «Connect».

7
00:00:27.842 --> 00:00:31.821 line:88%
Or in Notion itself: «•••» → Connections → + Add connection.

8
00:00:31.871 --> 00:00:39.510 line:88%
Sharing a parent page shares everything inside it.
